# The area map (port/host/automap.cpp, tools/automap_test.py) with SDL events from ELTALE_INPUT_TEST (a hidden
# window): TICK = pad reads. Enter skips the intro to the title, where ELTALE_QUICK_LOAD_AT=100 loads the user's quick
# save compass-spirit (map 0 area 1). Then M opens the full map, the wheel zooms in two steps, a left drag moves it,
# a right click fits it again, W walks with the map open (the game is not paused), Esc closes it, M opens it again
# and M closes it; ] ] [ zoom the minimap in twice and out once. tests/automap-none.events is the same without the
# map's keys and mouse: the player walks the same.
